# - The object of study is the tuning agent, not a potential; the eight MACE models differ in the training configuration each agent arrived at, which is recorded only as the agent's name. The actual hyperparameters per iteration (Tables 3 and 5: e.g. ScaleShiftMACE, Huber loss, epochs from 50 to 2000) were not read.
# - The Cu reference is the EMT model potential of ASE, encoded as a generic reference calculation; the errors on that set are relative to EMT, not to DFT.
